			"notes": "# Qianmo Swift Journey v1.3 Changelog\n\n1. **Added Permanent Road Speed Feature**\n   - **Permanent Speed Mechanism**: Now you can gain speed bonuses on roads even without wearing enchanted boots.\n   - **Disabled by Default**: Requires manual enabling in the configuration file.\n   - **Adjustable Rate**: Supports free adjustment from 1.0x (no bonus) to 3.0x (200% speed increase).\n\n2. **Optimized Airborne Speed Maintenance Mechanism**\n   - Improved logic for maintaining speed bonuses while jumping/airborne.\n\n3. **Optimized Road Detection Logic**\n   - Refined and enhanced the algorithm for detecting roads.\n\n4. **Attempted Deep Integration with RoadWeaver** (Not yet implemented)\n   - Experimental groundwork for future compatibility.\n\n5. **Improved Localization**\n   - Enhanced multilingual support with complete translations."
		},
